Error [E3304]: `core.http.server` is not available for target `wasm32-unknown-unknown`.
  --> tests/ui/wasip2_unsupported_surface_e3304.jet:2:5
    |
  2 | use core.http.server as http_server
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `core.http.server` needs native sockets or WASI Preview 2 sockets, and this target provides neither runtime boundary.
 Fix: build for `wasm32-wasip2` or a supported native target, or remove the `core.http.server` import.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3304
